<title>ROMANIA: Romanian leu 3,375 to dollar for October 31 - BNR.</title>
<headline>Romanian leu 3,375 to dollar for October 31 - BNR.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's National Bank (BNR) announced the leu's reference rate weaker at 3,375 to the dollar for October 31.</p>
<p>This reference rate was set on Tuesday as a weighted average based on daily reports of foreign exchange operators. It is a guidance rate used for statistical accounting purposes.</p>
<p>The leu's reference rate set on Monday for October 30 is 3,363 to the dollar. It was 3,341 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
